              "uzb": "Abdualining uyida 4 kishi bor.\r\nBu yil to'rt kishining yoshlarining yig'indisi 91 yosh.\r\nAbdualining otasi onasidan 5 yosh katta, Abdualining o'zi esa singlisidan 4 yosh katta.\r\nOlti yil oldingi barch…",
